    <description>#9084 - 2022-06-15
#7894
Technical evaluation : Enhancement: Value  of &quot;Revenue Forecast Name&quot; to &quot;Account-OppName-MonthID&quot;

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

#8538
We need to update the existing flow For &quot;Sales Billing Forecast Set Revenue Forecast Name&quot; that&apos;s been built in the List view for  &quot;Revenue Forecast Name&quot; Instead of &quot;Revenue Month Id&quot; we need to populate with &quot; Forecast Date&quot;</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>RevenueForecastName</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>TRIM(LEFT( {!$Record.Forecast_Opportunity__r.Account.Name} , 26))+&apos;-&apos;+TRIM(LEFT( {!$Record.Forecast_Opportunity__r.Name} , 26))+&apos;-&apos;+if(text({!$Record.Forecast_Revenue_Date__c})!=&apos;&apos;,text(MONTH({!$Record.Forecast_Revenue_Date__c}))+ &quot;/&quot; +text(DAY({!$Record.Forecast_Revenue_Date__c}))+ &quot;/&quot; +text(YEAR({!$Record.Forecast_Revenue_Date__c})),{!$Record.Id})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Revenue Forecast Name {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>For Sales Billing Forecast Set Revenue Forecast Name</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
